#. module: project_subcontracting
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_subcontracting
msgid ""
"\n"
"Project Subcontracting\n"
"======================\n"
"Projects marked as *Subcontracting* run their tasks with subcontracted "
"implementers.\n"
"*Subcontracting* is an option of *Timesheets*: it only shows with them and "
"is turned off\n"
"with them.\n"
"\n"
"* Each task of these projects has a subcontracting hour cost.\n"
"* The hours an assignee logs on a done task are *to bill*. *Bill Hours*, on "
"the chosen\n"
"  timesheets, creates one draft vendor bill per collaborator, with a "
"*Subcontracted Hours*\n"
"  line per task: the hours, the task's hour cost and the project's analytic "
"account.\n"
"* Each timesheet is linked to its bill line and cannot be changed or deleted "
"while the\n"
"  bill is not cancelled.\n"
"* The task warns about what departs from that flow: an hour cost of 0, hours "
"logged by\n"
"  someone not assigned, hours to bill on a done task, and hours over the "
"planned ones.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: project_subcontracting
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/project_subcontracting/models/project_task.py:0
msgid ""
"%(logged)s hours were logged and %(planned)s were planned: the extra hours "
"are billed at the task's cost and take provision meant for other tasks. "
"Adjust the planned hours or decide whether to pay them."
msgstr ""
"Se registraron %(logged)s horas y se planearon %(planned)s: las horas de más "
"se facturan al costo de la tarea y consumen provisión de otras tareas. "
"Ajuste las horas planeadas o decida si se pagan."

